{"pageProps":{"tabData":["1-39"],"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000024152","bookName":"Goodbye, My Ungrateful Family","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024152/42000024152.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":88686,"followCount":5319,"introduction":"Steven gave up his career for the woman he loved, only to watch her grow closer to another man. Haunted by a vision of a future where his family chooses someone else, he leaves before his heart can break. Now, the wife who ignored him will do anything to bring him home.","chapterCount":39,"labels":["Winning Him Back","Love Triangle"],"tags":["Winning Him Back","Love Triangle"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Goodbye-My-Ungrateful-Family","bookNameLower":"goodbye-my-ungrateful-family","shelfTime":"2026-08-16 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-16 10:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"recommends":[{"bookId":"42000023457","bookName":"Fire on Ice","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023457/42000023457.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":27286,"introduction":"A fiercely competitive hockey rivalry turns dangerously intimate when underdog Luke's obsession with his rival Felix crosses the line between hatred and desire, putting their careers, family expectations, and reputations at risk. ","chapterCount":56,"labels":["Underdog Story","Modern"],"tags":["Underdog Story","Modern"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Fire-on-Ice","bookNameLower":"fire-on-ice","shelfTime":"2026-08-12 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-12 10:00:00","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000021850","bookName":"I Loved You in Life, You Loved Me in Loss","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000021850/42000021850.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":938,"introduction":"Seven years after Han Eunbyeol vanishes, Lee Jaehoon gets a call from their young daughter, only to learn that she’d passed away long ago. Holding her empty urn, he realizes the only part of her left in this world is the child they share. Grief nearly drives him to follow her in death, but for his daughter’s sake, he chooses to persevere. Even so, one heartbreaking truth remains: the one person who gave his life meaning is already gone.","chapterCount":30,"labels":["Family Bonds","Redemption"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Redemption"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"I-Loved-You-in-Life-You-Loved-Me-in-Loss","bookNameLower":"i-loved-you-in-life-you-loved-me-in-loss","shelfTime":"2026-08-11 10:45:39","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-11 10:45:39","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000024327","bookName":"The Sweetest Substitute, Forever His Only One（DUBBED）","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024327/42000024327.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":4566,"introduction":"Switched at birth, Rhea Roth grows up in poverty and is finally brought home at 19. Her family brings her back only to force her to marry a man believed to be dead, in place of the fake heiress. Everyone assumes her life is over—but the powerful man, who is supposedly dead, is very much alive.","chapterCount":90,"labels":["Love After Marriage","Billionaire"],"tags":["Love After Marriage","Billionaire"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Sweetest-Substitute-Forever-His-Only-One（DUBBED）","bookNameLower":"the-sweetest-substitute-forever-his-only-one-dubbed","shelfTime":"2026-08-12 16:35:35","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-12 16:35:35","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000024255","bookName":"The Sin of Loving You","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024255/42000024255.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":12767,"introduction":"After eight years of suffering, Clara Hale gets a second chance at the moment her nightmare began. This time, she cuts ties with Adrian Gordon, the man she was never supposed to love, humiliates his perfect girl, and takes down everyone who hurt her. But when Clara walks away for good, the man who once treated her like nothing finally breaks down: “Clara, please. Don’t leave me.”","chapterCount":70,"labels":["Second Chance","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Second Chance","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Sin-of-Loving-You","bookNameLower":"the-sin-of-loving-you","shelfTime":"2026-08-11 15:55:40","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-11 15:55:40","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000024157","bookName":"Meant to Love You Forever","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024157/42000024157.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":4984,"introduction":"After catching her fiancé cheating with her stepsister, Claire Grant has a one-night stand with his uncle, Adrian Foster. A month later, she discovers she’s pregnant, and Adrian proposes a marriage of convenience. But when Claire learns she’s only a replacement for his lost love, their marriage falls apart. After a crash leaves her childless and Adrian amnesiac, Claire refuses to walk away, determined to help him remember the love they once shared.","chapterCount":92,"labels":["Forbidden Love","Modern"],"tags":["Forbidden Love","Modern"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Meant-to-Love-You-Forever","bookNameLower":"meant-to-love-you-forever","shelfTime":"2026-08-11 09:49:24","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-11 09:49:24","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000024646","bookName":"Echoes of Eternity: Until the Stars Remember  ","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024646/42000024646.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":781,"introduction":"A forbidden love between two immortals sparks a curse spanning three lifetimes. Cast into the mortal world with no memory, he is consumed by resentment and turns on the woman he once loved. She escapes, raises their gifted child, and returns as a fearless warrior seeking revenge. When an ancient relic restores their memories, father and child become bitter enemies, while their mischievous little one schemes to reunite them.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Family Bonds","Cultivation Fantasy"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Cultivation Fantasy"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Echoes-of-Eternity-Until-the-Stars-Remember--","bookNameLower":"echoes-of-eternity-until-the-stars-remember","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:29:53","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:29:53","performerIdList":[]}],"chapterList":[{"id":"701451903","name":"第一集","index":0,"indexStr":"001","unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/30/2x5/25x1/251x4/25142000024/701451903_1/701451903.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1786996800&Signature=gfC93B5Tt8vNl-dIbRm29mmWehfZuwAjD~lnnFmEgoR8aGsLh6c0BQrbflWlbJAazz7MZPN7SAxi7ZW6ACr2U09b-iK2Og~WQSbdqlAXiGaoemiRB7k7wjmjPIZyLgCDXui32MUpghHRv4mIhq~I5ek6UkP-GNOnW8kbjR~KICfUnsVt5PE1~DNRITOb7Yh8fkbbB8dj1mKQLfcNr6-Up-9Itz8bun47qwbeIPNHJltx96kSgSofmVGxdJtbEPuHjqRoXhrTxC5yOOfvim1aR2HC999nqe2W5IOhrG0W5ySKsRu3